  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Algeria &#x2013; Roadmap2startup</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to provide aspiring entrepreneurs from Algeria with a practical, realistic, step-by-step guide on the process of starting a business. The process is now unclear, and there is a discrepancy between the theory of starting a business, and the reality of it.Service provider Sylabs, in collaboration with students from a University in Algiers, will write and publish such a guide. The guide will contain a step-by-step guide, an overview of rules and regulations, tips and tricks from experts and young entrepreneurs themselves, identified blockages and recommendations.</narrative>
  </description>
